!Sample_description	"To export to gene expression data based on unique gene, we used Sample Gene Profile option of Illumina BeadStudio software. The whole 48702 probes on the Human-6 beadChip ver.2 were used. Clinical data provided as a supplementary file on Series record:GSE13898_EAC_MDACC_DepSysB_ClinicalInformation.txt.gz"	"To export to gene expression data based on unique gene, we used Sample Gene Profile option of Illumina BeadStudio software. The whole 48702 probes on the Human-6 beadChip ver.2 were used. Clinical data provided as a supplementary file on Series record:GSE13898_EAC_MDACC_DepSysB_ClinicalInformation.txt.gz"	"To export to gene expression data based on unique gene, we used Sample Gene Profile option of Illumina BeadStudio software. The whole 48702 probes on the Human-6 beadChip ver.2 were used. Clinical data provided as a supplementary file on Series record:GSE13898_EAC_MDACC_DepSysB_ClinicalInformation.txt.gz"	"To export to gene expression data based on unique gene, we used Sample Gene Profile option of Illumina BeadStudio software. The whole 48702 probes on the Human-6 beadChip ver.2 were used. Clinical data provided as a supplementary file on Series record:GSE13898_EAC_MDACC_DepSysB_ClinicalInformation.txt.gz"	"To export to gene expression data based on unique gene, we used Sample Gene Profile option of Illumina BeadStudio software. The whole 48702 probes on the Human-6 beadChip ver.2 were used. Clinical data provided as a supplementary file on Series record:GSE13898_EAC_MDACC_DepSysB_ClinicalInformation.txt.gz"	"To export to gene expression data based on unique gene, we used Sample Gene Profile option of Illumina BeadStudio software. The whole 48702 probes on the Human-6 beadChip ver.2 were used. Clinical data provided as a supplementary file on Series record:GSE13898_EAC_MDACC_DepSysB_ClinicalInformation.txt.gz"	"To export to gene expression data based on unique gene, we used Sample Gene Profile option of Illumina BeadStudio software. The who